  "prefLabel": "Ins 2201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2201.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to delineate a system for regulation of health maintenance organizations that is fair and efficient, and promotes their continued solvency.\n\nSource. #9335, eff 12-5-08; ss by #11194, eff 12-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2200.html"
